23-07:00","id":859547,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/851344-we-finally-know-what-will-be-in-the-pack?p=859366#post859366\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Some new art from the Pack by Brian Leblanc, available on the <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/what-the-heck-is-that-monday-meeting-notes/\" target=\"_blank\">Monday Meeting post</a>. The Pack is at proofing with Stew.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/Leblanc_The-Pack.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bOh lovely, it's in colour too; I wasn't sure if the supplements would get that treatment.<br /> <br /> That's the art for the chapter 4 intro fic. Here you can see five members of a Bangkok pack all attempting to take on one large, angry Predator King. Yes, five <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>- Chris Allen, Aberrant Line Developer, Freelance Writer<br /> <br /> \u200bLike my work? Feel like helping me stay supplied with tea? Check out my <b><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/acrozatarim\" target=\"_blank\">Patreon</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1757-acrozatarim","name":"Acr